welcome guest in the Velvet Room.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:34.020
Your Persona is a Wild Card.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.230
It is unique unto itself.

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:42.030
Just like the number zero, it holds an
infinite number of possibilities.

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:48.980
I wonder where your newly awoken powers
with the Wild Card will take you.

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:52.470
