Satonaka!

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:49.400
Satonaka!

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:51.490
Hey, Satonaka! Hang in there!

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:55.470
Satonaka...

00:02:55.470 --> 00:02:56.500
