00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:20.400
Screw that, let's leave before
more of those weird creatures show up.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.160
Huh?

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:23.360
Man, I'd love to, but...

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:25.270
How?

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:28.770
An... exit?

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:30.640
Found ya at last!

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:33.280
You seem familiar enough with the area and all.

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:35.910
More importantly, what'd you do
about the Shadows?

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:38.050
Shadows? You mean those monsters?

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:39.180
You got it.

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:40.450
Yeah, right!

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:42.080
Were they your doing?

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:44.590
Don't be a dummy bear!

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:49.150
I've had it up to here with people barging in
and driving the Shadows nutty!

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:53.330
Wha-?!

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:54.430
TVs?

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:57.230
Now off with you! Beat it!

00:03:57.230 --> 00:03:59.840
I'm a beary busy bear.

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:00.400
H... hey! What're you doing?!

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:01.600
Go, go, go, go!
H... hey! What're you doing?!

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:02.370
Cool it!

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:03.670
H-h-h-hey!

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.880
Ow, ow, ow...

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:13.710
Damn that bear!

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:15.440
We're back!

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:17.990
Thank God!

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:19.750
It's great to be alive!

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.890
How dare you take advantage of the situation?!

