00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:48.080
Hey, now. So what's this about that freaky room?

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:52.250
There might be a connection
between it and Ms. Yamano's death.

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:53.960
Don't go there!

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:56.530
I don't think my heart can take it!

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:59.300
Yikes! The restroom! I gotta use the restroom!

00:04:59.300 --> 00:04:59.830
I'm starting to get the chills.
Yikes! The restroom! I gotta use the restroom!

