I'm starting to get the chills.
I'm gonna pee myself! Gotta run!

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:02.670
I feel sick, so I'm going home.
I'm gonna pee myself! Gotta run!

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:04.230
I feel sick, so I'm going home.

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:05.360
Okay...

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:16.630
I swear I went through hell yesterday.

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:17.950
What happened?

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:20.420
I'll tell you all about it later.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.380
But you might not believe me.

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:24.620
Hey, aren't you Yukiko?

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:25.420
Huh?

00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:30.860
I've been waiting all morning, Yukiko.

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:33.350
Wh... who are you?

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:37.200
C'mon, let's go hang out somewhere.

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:40.330
Hey, you're scaring her!

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:42.170
Come on already, Yukiko!

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:43.840
What school's that creep from?
Come on already, Yukiko!

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:45.700
Doesn't he know that Amagi's untouchable?

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:49.200
Are you going or not? Well?!

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:52.280
I'm not going.

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:55.220
Screw you!

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:56.740
Damn bitch!

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:00.520
Yo!

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:01.460
Good morning.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:02.930
Oh, good morning.

00:06:02.930 --> 00:06:03.760
What did...

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:04.590
Huh?
What did...

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:06.200
...he want from me?

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:09.030
Say what? He was hoping for a date!

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:10.590
He was?

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:12.960
You couldn't tell?

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:16.440
Dang, you're a harsh one!

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:18.910
You cut me down last year, too.

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:20.110
She did?

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:21.910
I did not.

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:24.080
Then could we go out together sometime?

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:25.610
I'd rather not.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:27.010
Oh, okay...

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:29.520
But that's cool!

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:31.650
My sights are set on someone else anyway.

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:33.320
It's Konishi, right?

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:34.890
Yep!

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:39.850
But she's blown off all my texts since yesterday...

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:43.020
Huh?

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:45.170
Oh, jeez...

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:46.930
Another accident?

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:51.140
Huh? Where's Amagi?

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.380
She got a call from her family.

00:06:53.380 --> 00:06:56.780
She said she had to go home
and help with the inn.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:58.510
What inn?

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:03.220
Yukiko's family runs the nicest
traditional inn in town.

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:05.820
Yukiko's next in line to inherit the place.

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:07.050
Oh...

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:09.790
But seriously, what could be keeping Senpai?

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:12.360
She still hasn't responded...

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:14.630
Listen up!

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:18.470
The Principal has something to tell you,
so shut up and listen good!

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:22.300
I'll put anyone who yaps
down in my rotten shit list!

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:24.240
Now shuddup!

