00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:35.980
Saki Konishi from 3-B was found dead
early this morning.

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:37.590
Huh?

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:40.650
Please remain quiet.

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:46.250
I have confirmed with her teachers
that no bullying was involved...

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:52.070
Her body was hung up somewhere
just like Ms. Yamano.

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.230
This time it was a phone pole!

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:00.140
Hanamura!

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:06.370
Tell me, did you watch the
Midnight Channel last night?

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:09.920
How dare you bring that up now?!

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:11.180
Hear me out!

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:17.380
Last night, I just had to watch it again.

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:21.250
I think the girl on the screen was Konishi.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:24.460
Don't you remember?

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:31.070
Someone claimed Ms. Yamano was his soulmate
after he saw her on the Midnight Channel.

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:32.640
Oh, yeah...

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:38.600
I heard that Senpai died practically
the same way as Ms. Yamano.

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:40.920
Bit much for coincidence?

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:43.020
You don't think...

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:47.610
You mean anyone who gets shown
on that program dies?

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:51.760
Remember how Misuzu Hiiragi's
posters were inside the TV?

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:56.130
So the world inside the TV is
somehow related to these cases?

00:08:57.530 --> 00:09:01.530
What if Senpai and Ms. Yamano
went to that world?!

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:04.930
Hanamura, you wouldn't!

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:08.180
Seriously, don't do this!

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:10.710
We've already escaped once.

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:15.380
And we might run into that bear again
if we use the same entrance.

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:17.820
But you don't know that for sure!

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:20.890
Fine, I'll go with you.

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:22.080
What?!

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:23.890
For real?

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:26.360
You'll be a huge help on the other side.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.730
Satonaka, watch over this.

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:33.140
Wait, are you two serious?

00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:34.970
Stop asking that.

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:37.970
So then, you ready?

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:39.070
Yeah!

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:44.340
H... hey, wait a sec!

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:59.790
Crap, I knew it.

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:02.160
It didn't work!

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:03.790
What should I do?

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:13.460
Ow, that hurt...

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:16.580
It... it's you!

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:18.310
You came back?!

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:20.580
It's the same place as last time.

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:22.720
You're mighty suspicious bear-actors.

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:23.650
Huh?

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:28.760
Lately someone from the other side's been
stuffing people here whenever the fog clears up.

00:10:28.760 --> 00:10:29.960
The fog?

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:33.860
When it's foggy on your side,
the fog here lifts up.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:39.360
Now that you mention it, it was foggy
when both murders occurred.

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:42.740
It looks like you brought yourselves here.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:45.710
That means you could throw people in, too.

00:10:45.710 --> 00:10:48.200
As such, you're the culprits!

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:50.610
Don't be stupid!

00:10:50.610 --> 00:10:51.650
Who'd want to-

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:52.710
Just maybe...

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:53.720
Huh?

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:59.210
There's a chance someone may have thrown
Konishi and Ms. Yamano into this world.

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:03.160
And you're the ones doing it!

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:04.530
Come clean!

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:09.430
Say what?! I bet you're the one
who dragged Senpai here!

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:13.740
Take off that dumb costume and show yourself!

00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:15.140
Stop it!

00:11:15.140 --> 00:11:16.070
Take it off!

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:20.730
Wh... what the hell?!

00:11:22.210 --> 00:11:24.470
There's nothing inside?

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:28.810
It's empty! How's that work?!

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:32.250
Thanks, Pal.

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:34.690
Narukami, you're pretty thick-skinned.

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:35.560
Hm?

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:39.860
I'll take your word that you grizzlies didn't do it.

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:42.200
Why the sudden change of heart?

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:48.700
But in exchange, I want you to find the
real culprit, and make him stop doing this!

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:49.940
The culprit?

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:54.740
I just wanna live in beartiful peace and quiet.

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:57.010
What's his problem?

00:11:57.010 --> 00:11:59.780
You're the only ones I can turn to!

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:01.680
Will you promise to find him?

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:04.450
Why the heck would we-

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:05.250
Sure thing.

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:07.880
No way! You're on the case?!

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:10.780
Well, I feel sorry for him.

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:13.300
Th... that's great!

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:16.090
You're one insanely nice guy, you know.

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:18.030
I guess I'm in.

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:21.560
But in exchange, you gotta
help us out, Kumakichi!

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:26.040
Wow! I can see so much better now.

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:29.040
Dude, doesn't this look like
the shopping district?

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:32.110
This is around where I saw that girl la-

00:12:32.110 --> 00:12:32.980
Hey, Kuma!

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:35.970
Was this the girl you mentioned?

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:37.680
Yeah, that's her!

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:40.880
I lost track of her when she went in that store.

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:43.650
That's Konishi's house.

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:45.820
Do you hear something?

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:48.700
I wish Junes'd go under!

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:52.600
I hear Saki from the Konishi family's working there.

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:56.230
And here it's Junes' fault
the shopping district's in the red.

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:57.540
What a brat.

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:00.010
Dammit, who's saying that?!

00:13:00.140 --> 00:13:01.300
Cut it out!

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:02.600
Hanamura!

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:06.200
How many times must I tell you, Saki?

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:06.880
Huh?!

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:10.910
Where's your pride as the oldest daughter
behind Konishi Liquors?!

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:13.850
How dare you get a frickin' part-time job at Junes?!

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:16.690
Is that her dad's voice?

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:18.730
Why can I hear his voice?

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:20.850
Hey, is someone here?!

