I gave her that...

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:31.470
I could never tell him.

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:33.210
Konishi-senpai?!

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:35.340
Senpai! Senpai!

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:37.610
Where are you, Senpai?!

00:13:37.610 --> 00:13:39.810
I feel Hana is...

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:42.850
What about me?

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:45.320
...a pain in the ass.

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:51.420
I was only nice to him because his dad
is the manager at Junes.

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:55.860
It's annoying how he'd take it the wrong way
and get all worked up.

00:13:55.860 --> 00:13:57.490
I'm annoying?

00:13:57.970 --> 00:14:00.430
I don't care about Junes!

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:03.370
Same for my shop, the shopping district,
and my parents!

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:06.270
I wish everyone'd just die!

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:09.310
You're lying! That's a lie.

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:12.510
It's a lie! Senpai would never say that!

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:18.580
How sad...

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:20.820
Poor baby!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:26.450
But you're the one who really thinks
everything's friggin' annoying.

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:34.660
