00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:28.340
I know just how lame you really are!

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:32.650
C'mon, let's ask Hanamura for help.

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:34.150
You mean Junes' prince?

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:39.150
He thinks everyone actually relies on him
since he's the manager's son.

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:40.410
What a loser!

00:17:41.060 --> 00:17:43.760
