You're wrong, wrong, wrong, wrong!

00:18:15.890 --> 00:18:16.560
I'm not like that!

00:18:16.560 --> 00:18:16.660
Izanagi!
I'm not like that!

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:17.280
Izanagi!

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:21.700
