00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:57.000
I'm so desperate to get along with everyone
that I try to act cool.

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:59.990
Even I think I'm damn annoying.

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:00.870
Runway Hearts

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:04.770
Runway Hearts
But my feelings for Senpai were real.

00:19:07.510 --> 00:19:09.940
